    "name": "PTITMeet - Module 1 Full Test Cases",
    "description": "Full Postman collection for Module 1: Authentication & User Profile.\n\nThis collection maps 18 test cases in `docs/test_cases.md` into Postman requests.\n\nHow to use:\n1. Set `baseUrl`.\n2. Update sample variables like `validEmail`, `existingEmail`, `validPassword`, `resetToken`.\n3. Run positive auth requests first to get a valid session or paste JWT into `accessToken`.\n4. Protected profile requests use `Authorization: Bearer {{accessToken}}`.\n\nImportant backend note:\n- The backend also supports cookie auth, but cookies are currently created with `Secure=true`, so local plain HTTP may not persist cookies as expected in Postman/browser.\n- If login response does not include tokens in body, manually paste a valid JWT into `accessToken` before running protected requests.",
    "schema": "https://schema.getpostman.com/json/collection/v2.1.0/collection.json"
  },
